  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đúng. Số phần tử của mẫu là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng. Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>42</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> mà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm đầu tiên có tần số tích luỹ lớn hơn hoặc bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Sai. Xét nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/